      ],
      "justification": "Negative requirement outcome guard and the continuation action match directly."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n9",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the test is not green, they should upgrade the test level."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative test-status guard and the corresponding upgrade action align perfectly."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, they need to check if the level satisfies the project requirements again."
      ],
      "justification": "Second requirement-check action and its subsequent decision split."
